// General FAQ topic coverage checked against Calibre end-of-lease page on 2026-11-08. Answers independently adapted for Breeze; no Calibre deadlines, free-remedy terms or service durations imported.
const faqs=[
['prepare','What if I have already moved out?','Breeze can plan the clean around an empty property. Confirm how the team will get in, keep electricity and hot water connected, and tell us about any belongings left behind.',true],
['scope','What is included in an bond clean?','The proposed standard scope includes accessible surfaces and floors, kitchens, bathrooms and empty cupboards. The draft Breeze checklist also includes the first oven inside and out, ordinary internal windows and tracks, light wall spot-cleaning and the dishwasher exterior. The final scope will be confirmed before this page goes live.',true],
['scope','Is the oven included?','The first oven, inside and out, is included in the draft package. An additional oven can be selected separately. Heavy build-up should be flagged so the work can be assessed.',true],
['scope','Are windows included?','Ordinary internal windows and tracks are part of the proposed base scope. Exterior windows and additional large glass panels are separate options. Accessible height and the exact number of panels need confirmation.',true],
['scope','Is carpet steam cleaning included?','Carpet steam cleaning is a separate option. Rooms, hallways and stairs can be selected individually. The latest extras table lists A$90 per room up to 10 m². Hallways are A$40 each up to 6 m², and stair flights A$90 each up to 15 steps. Larger areas need review.',true],
['scope','Can you remove every stain, mark or patch of mould?','Some marks are permanent wear, damage or a specialist issue rather than ordinary cleaning. If photos are needed, our team will ask after you enquire. Do not assume all stains or mould can be removed.',true],
['price','How is my estimate calculated?','Choose the property, bedroom and bathroom count, levels and extras. This prototype shows the available preview draft rates. Property-type adjustments, heavy-condition work and “from” items may need a separate assessment.',true],
['price','Is GST included?','Extra cards and itemised extra services show prices excluding GST. A separate Extras 10% GST line is added in your estimate, and this tax is included in the final total. The base clean price already includes GST and is not taxed again.',true],
['price','Will there be additional charges?','The aim is to agree the scope and total before work starts. Items outside the chosen package, heavy build-up or access constraints should be reviewed first. The final approval and charging process is still being defined.',true],
['price','Can I choose only the extras I need?','Yes, the preview lets you select individual extras and quantities. Anything already included in the base package should not be selected and charged again.',false],
['prepare','Does the property need to be empty?','An empty property makes it easier to access floors, cupboards and surfaces. Plan to move your belongings out first, and flag anything that will remain so the cleaning scope can be agreed.',true],
['prepare','Do I need to be home during the clean?','Access arrangements can be discussed before the visit. This draft does not assume a particular key collection service or require you to stay throughout the clean.',true],
['prepare','What should I prepare before the cleaners arrive?','Have electricity and hot water available, arrange entry and parking, and keep your agent’s checklist handy. Empty cupboards and appliances that you want cleaned inside.',false],
['prepare','Can I add balconies, garages or outdoor areas?','These are separate selections in the draft service options. Area, condition and access matter. Pressure washing, rubbish removal and heavy oil treatment are not automatically included.',true],
['booking','How far ahead should I book?','Allow time between moving out, cleaning and the final inspection. Availability and lead times need confirmation with the team; this prototype does not reserve a date.',true],
['booking','How long will the clean take?','Time depends on size, condition and the agreed extras. The team should confirm an appropriate plan after reviewing the property rather than promising the same duration for every home.',true],
['booking','What if the agent raises a cleaning issue?','If a cleaning-related issue affects the return of your bond, Breeze will provide a re-clean. Tell the team about the issue; they will ask for inspection notes or photos if needed during follow-up. The arrangements and detailed terms still need confirmation.',true],
['booking','Do you guarantee my bond will be returned?','Breeze will re-clean if a cleaning-related issue affects your bond return. This is a cleaning assurance, not a guarantee of the full bond: rent, damage and other lease matters are outside the cleaning service. Detailed re-clean arrangements remain subject to confirmation.',true],
['booking','When will I pay?','There is no deposit. A card pre-authorisation may temporarily reduce your available balance. Payment is due after the clean, once you have inspected and approved the work.',true]
];
